  <description>
    <p>
      Links organizes everyday URLs, files, terminal commands, and clipboard
      templates into searchable folders and cards.
    </p>
    <p>
      It is built with Python, GTK4, and Libadwaita for a native experience
      across GNOME, KDE Plasma, XFCE, Wayland, and X11.
    </p>
  </description>
